# 统一换行符为 LF，避免 Windows 与 macOS/Linux 协作者出现大量 CRLF 变更
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不参与换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
